---
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, GITHUB_URL, ISSUES_URL, RELEASES_URL } from "@/lib/site";
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-border bg-card/40">
  <div class="container-page grid gap-10 py-12 md:grid-cols-12">
    <div class="md:col-span-5">
      <p class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Gozdar</p>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-sm text-[0.95rem] text-muted-foreground">
        Terenska aplikacija za lastnike gozdov in gozdarske delavce v Sloveniji.
      </p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Noga strani" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-[0.95rem] md:col-span-7 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-foreground">Aplikacija</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-muted-foreground">
          <li><a class="hover:text-foreground" href="/#funkcije">Funkcije</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-foreground" href="/#prenos">Prenos</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-foreground" href={RELEASES_URL}>Izdaje na GitHubu</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-foreground">Pomoč</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-muted-foreground">
          <li><a class="hover:text-foreground" href="/podpora/">Podpora</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-foreground" href={ISSUES_URL}>Prijava napake</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-foreground break-all" href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-foreground">Pravno</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-muted-foreground">
          <li><a class="hover:text-foreground" href="/zasebnost/">Zasebnost</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-foreground" href={GITHUB_URL}>Izvorna koda</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <div class="container-page flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-border/60 py-6 text-sm text-faint sm:flex-row sm:justify-between">
    <p>© {year} Gozdar. Podatki o parcelah so informativni; uradni vir sta GURS in ZGS.</p>
    <p>Karte: ZGS, GURS, OpenStreetMap, Esri.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
